{
  "about": "OZ source labels Klive cannot take as they are, and the names they take in z88v47.rom.dis (dev/plans/Z88_OZ47_ROM_ANNOTATIONS_PLAN.md, Phase 2): names over the 16 characters a Klive label may have (keyed by the name), and names two modules of a bank share (keyed `file:name`). Proposed by shortLabelName (src/common/roms/ozSourceAligner.ts) and recorded by `import-oz-source.cjs --all --write-renames`; edit any entry by hand, and the hand-made name wins on the next import. Reviewed 2026-11-15: 347 of the 574 proposals were replaced by readable names (one abbreviation per word: Cmd, Msg, Rcv, Snd, Xfer, Hnd, Dir, Dflt, Sel, Chk, Del, Fmt, Ptr, Pos, Cur, Prev; a module suffix in its own short form), checked to be unique across all banks. Each renamed label names its source label in its synopsis (\"OZ source name: ...\", written by tools/z88-source-name-notes.cjs).",
